# Day 1 投票で Alice (子狐) を処刑。 engine が auto-info:execution-species trait を発動し、
# 霊能者 Bob の mediumHistory[1] に { target: Alice, result: 'kogitsune' } を記録。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=子狐
!Bob=霊能者
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Bob→Alice
Carol→Alice
Dave→Alice
Eve→Alice
Alice→Bob

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Alice 4 / Bob 1 → execution=Alice
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==
# == engine: Day 2 ==
# vote tally: Bob 3 / Carol 1 → execution=Bob
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 2 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==
# == engine: Day 3 ==
# vote tally: Carol 2 / Dave 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Dave, Eve
# == end ==

# @expect-status Alice: dead
# @expect-medium actor:Bob day:1 target:Alice result:kogitsune
